      "snippet": "# 2026-04-03 ## Morning Idea — What-If Reframe - **Topic:** Defer sync mode choice out of onboarding - **Angle:** What-if reframe (from March 31 persona reviews) - **Idea:** Remove sync mode selection from onboarding entirely. Default everyone to Summary mode, then surface Per-Transaction as an upgrade prompt after first successful sync — when users have context to decide. Eliminates the scariest moment in onboarding (all 3 personas flagged \"requires new org\" as conversion killer). - **Built on:** March 31 persona panel — Viktor rated sync mode selection as #1 universal finding, Mike gave 40-50% quit risk --- ## End-of-Day Progress Snapshot (23:00 Vilnius) ### What Happened Today - Light",
