      "snippet": "- **0 rage clicks** on summaries pages — no frustration signals - Top user: matt@kaikei.co.uk with 56 sessions (1.7% of all) - Top 10 users = 474 sessions = ~14.5% of all summaries traffic - Clickable elements found: \"Amount\", \"Show\", page-size dropdown (10/25/50/100), \"Apply filter\", \"Apply\", \"Show in\", \"Linked Transactions\", \"Failed\" - Funnel list→detail built but exact % not returned (Galileo API bug) - Dead clicks metric built but numbers not returned (same bug) - Key issue from Ignat: \"Attention Required\" summaries confuse new users — caused by import date cascade (Sept summary needs Aug transactions, Aug needs July, etc.) - Ignat also asks about full-screen overlays for big tables ##",
