      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "# 2026-04-16 ## Morning Idea — Accessibility/Edge Case - **Topic:** Progressive enhancement for pricing yearly toggle - **Angle:** Accessibility/edge case (from April 15 pricing prototype) - **Idea:** Show both prices in HTML (monthly strikethrough + yearly bold), then use JS to collapse into toggle. No JS = users still see the 20% OFF deal. Helps screen readers, ad blockers, crawlers. Zero visual change for 99%, full information for the 1% with JS failures. - **Built on:** April 15 pricing prototype — yearly toggle with \"20% OFF\" badge assumes JS works; edge case is invisible broken experience ## Pricing Prototype — 5 Variants Complete (4:00 PM) Built 5 pricing page variants for Synder'",
